OL,3,GNEWSANew hospital opening date delayed
OL,4,Aby another year
OL,5,
OL,6,FDelays to the national hospital rebuild
OL,7,Fprogramme are being blamed for the
OL,8,Ftimeline for a new Norfolk hospital
OL,9,Fslipping by a year.
OL,11,FA new-look Queen Elizabeth Hospital
OL,12,F(QEH) in King's Lynn, Norfolk, was due
OL,13,Fto open in 2032, with the current site
OL,14,Fsuffering for years with crumbling
OL,15,Fconcrete.
OL,17,FBut Prof Lesley Dwyer, chief executive
OL,18,Fof the Norfolk and Waveney University
OL,19,FHospitals Group, confirmed at a
OL,20,Fstakeholder meeting that work was now
OL,21,Fexpected to be finished in 2033.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
