OL,3,GNEWSANew hospital opening date delayed
OL,4,Aby another year
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department of Health and Social
OL,7,FCare has been approached for comment.
OL,8,FIt previously told the BBC it had
OL,9,F"confirmed a sustainable funding plan
OL,10,Fand an achievable timetable" for the
OL,11,Fprojects nationally.
